@title Pin names: Load company file with no file says so and changes nothing (1920x1080)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1920x1080
# A fresh profile has no pin-templates.toml. "Load company file" shows "No company file to load" and the box stays empty.
open qa/fixtures/pin-names.kopercad
wait 30
key ctrl+k
wait 10
text rules
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
scroll 960 500 -600
wait 10
click_text "Load company file"
wait 10
shot missing
expect "No company file to load"
expect "Built-in names only"
check_layout
